description	"Covert Ops Trooper

^9Weapons:
- Heavy Melee
^2-- Lightweight

^3Abilities:
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
^2- Hacking: 1.15x
- Reinforcements (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Tracking Receiver
- Knockdown Roll
- Grapple Hop
- Slow Faller

Republic Intelligence specialists designed for infiltration and false-flag operations."